    "detailed_description": "Let's relax and enjoy a peaceful pool with various swimming animals!<br>You will receive a full kit that you can enjoy pool vacation! From the sky!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/6a1492963a6ed8d334a96e3866317c64.poster.avif?t=1678101146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/6a1492963a6ed8d334a96e3866317c64.webm?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/6a1492963a6ed8d334a96e3866317c64.mp4?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong><i>What kind of game is Full Moon Kit?</i></strong><br><br>Spacing out and find refreshment with the swimming toy!<br>You can just watch out or control swimming animals.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/13690639cafdbfadaadc3e5e692f1824.poster.avif?t=1678101146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/13690639cafdbfadaadc3e5e692f1824.webm?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/13690639cafdbfadaadc3e5e692f1824.mp4?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong><i>What kind of fun is it?</i></strong><br><br>You can relax and swim while controlling the toy freely.<br>Collect over 90+ animal friends!<br>You can ride a fountain and jumping board.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/9f02781ef913d68e8b8366b2a9cc6a8d.poster.avif?t=1678101146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/9f02781ef913d68e8b8366b2a9cc6a8d.webm?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/9f02781ef913d68e8b8366b2a9cc6a8d.mp4?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Meet the mysterious aurora.</strong><br><br>Enjoy healing comfortably in a cool and beautiful swimming pool.<br>Hold your breath and love dive!<br>Enjoy your life with cute friends who splash and float!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/85aa6267ab3a0a42751c9b9e79a7dde1.poster.avif?t=1678101146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/85aa6267ab3a0a42751c9b9e79a7dde1.webm?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204220/extras/85aa6267ab3a0a42751c9b9e79a7dde1.mp4?t=1678101146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
